Package: topGOflow
Title: Streamlined GO Term Enrichment with Expression-Matched Backgrounds
Version: 0.1.3.1
Authors@R: person("Lab", "Author", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "author@example.com")
Description: A wrapper around topGO for non-model organism GO enrichment analysis.
    Accepts GAF files or pre-built gene-to-GO mappings, performs expression-matched
    background selection via MatchIt (using a DESeq2 dds object) or accepts a
    user-supplied background, and returns tidy result tables. Designed for ease of
    use with graduate students and postdocs working on non-model species.
